ta):\n\tvar a = (load(data) as PackedScene).instantiate()\n\treturn a\n\nfunc start_network(server:bool) -> void:\n\t\tms.spawn(\"res://Menus/lobby.tscn\")\n\n\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3217378804/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3217390637","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109916#issuecomment-3217390637","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109916","id":3217390637,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_xXwt","user":{"login":"x0meko","id":94765731,"node_id":"U_kgDOBaYCow","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/94765731?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/x0meko","html_url":"https://github.com/x0meko","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/x0meko/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/x0meko/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/x0meko/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/x0meko/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/x0meko/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/x0meko/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/x0meko/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/x0meko/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/x0meko/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-23T20:43:15Z","updated_at":"2025-08-23T20:43:15Z","body":"Bad news guys - I'm dumb. Turns out I completely did not do my research about case-sensitivity and why it might become suddenly important when exporting your game. :|\n\nSorry about that - going to close this now.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactio